From 83b73b46158e02f5810d97ff3cdc2a92950b2cac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bar Moshe <1barmoshe1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:31:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(od-sevev): add Mordechai David's blockade event
 behind its flag
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bar reversed the pitch §2.10 drop: Mordechai David ships as a stage
event on Balfour, standing in front of the protest crowd. The content
lands with effect "none" and designerEffect "blockade" (the golan-card
pattern) and the flag still false, until the developer wires the effect
and the presenter (design/mordechai-david-spec.md §7).

- facts.json: refs 73-75 (the cars he blocked, his Kaplan rationale as
  reported speech, his paid youth-HQ role), launchWith mordechaiDavid;
  fact 47 (the Eisenkot exchange) gets its URLs and stays out for good
  (October 7 and army service)
- redlines.json: the name is narrowed, not lifted: scoped allows for the
  'mordechai' event and his three facts only
- HANDOFF: his event joins Bar's legal reads

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
